# Never commit original camera photos: they carry EXIF metadata such as the
# device, timestamps and possibly GPS. Only metadata-stripped copies made for
# the tests and the README screenshots are allowed.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.JPG
*.JPEG
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.dng
*.DNG
!tests/data/*.jpg
!docs/*.jpg
